Modifications
-------------

This distribution is a modified fork. Changes made by the dsrp project include,
among others:

  * A built-in mod catalog ported from Vencord's plugin list, with a Built-in Mods
    settings page, and native ports of individual mods.
  * OLED dark ("Eclipse") as the default colour preset.
  * A device-local entitlement override, as a Vencord FakeNitro port.
  * A tag-driven release workflow, replacing upstream's manual dispatch flow, and
    dropping macOS from the release matrix because it requires a paid Apple
    Developer account to sign.
  * A dependency fix forcing the vendored gpu-allocator onto the same Windows
    bindings as wgpu-hal, without which the Windows build does not compile.

